WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
Most businesses never make it to seven figures,

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.960
not because they lack ambition,

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.720
but because they lack leverage.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.680
This is The 789 Show,

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.600
where we break down how founders scale

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.640
from seven to eight to nine figures in revenue.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.600
I'm Kemi Kishi, and in each episode,

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.800
we go inside the decisions, systems,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.160
and strategies that actually drive growth

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.800
from operators who are doing it in real time.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.400
No fluff, no theory, just what works.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.400
Let's dive into it.
